WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:02.302
INTERVIEWER: You learned
English in Colombia

00:00:02.369 --> 00:00:03.570
or in the United States or--

00:00:03.636 --> 00:00:04.337
Watching TV, man.

00:00:04.404 --> 00:00:05.471
INTERVIEWER: Watching TV?

00:00:05.538 --> 00:00:08.375
Watching TV,
hiding all the time.

00:00:08.441 --> 00:00:12.412
My name is Sebastián Marroquín,
formerly Juan Pablo Escobar.

00:00:12.479 --> 00:00:14.280
I am the son of Pablo Escobar.

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:21.388
I grew up living a life full
of money, full of power.

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:29.229
My father at the time,
he was perhaps one

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:31.331
of the richest men in Colombia.

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:38.972
I realized very early that he
was a bandit because he told

00:00:39.038 --> 00:00:41.340
me when I was seven years old.

00:00:41.408 --> 00:00:43.443
So you can imagine,
being a child,

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:46.146
perhaps you know the
meaning of the word bandit.

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:49.616
But you don't realize
how huge the organization

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:54.387
was that my father
was in charge of.

00:00:54.454 --> 00:00:56.356
REPORTER: Pablo Escobar
has been identified

00:00:56.423 --> 00:00:58.458
by American authorities
as Colombia's

00:00:58.525 --> 00:01:00.560
leading exporter of cocaine.

00:01:00.627 --> 00:01:03.563
The Escobar family has
reportedly amassed nearly $2

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:08.001
billion smuggling 1,100
pounds of refined cocaine

00:01:08.067 --> 00:01:11.470
into the United
States every month.

00:01:11.538 --> 00:01:13.039
SEBASTI N MARROQU N: We
were living in a life

00:01:13.106 --> 00:01:16.609
that we felt power was endless.

00:01:21.014 --> 00:01:25.884
EXPERT: The Medellín Cartel was
very rough, very vindictive.

00:01:25.952 --> 00:01:28.288
The Cali people,
they looked at it

00:01:28.354 --> 00:01:30.723
more as a business to expand.

00:01:56.783 --> 00:02:11.598
[speaking in spanish]

00:02:11.664 --> 00:02:13.266
SEBASTI N MARROQU N:
The Cali cartel

00:02:13.333 --> 00:02:17.036
took control of all the Medellín
cartel routes in New York.

00:02:17.103 --> 00:02:19.272
And that make my
father very upset.

00:02:45.365 --> 00:03:04.517
MAR A ISABEL SANTOS:
[speaking in spanish]

00:03:04.584 --> 00:03:06.219
SEBASTI N MARROQU N:
The Mónaco building

00:03:06.286 --> 00:03:09.622
was our our family home.

00:03:09.689 --> 00:03:11.357
We used to live there.

00:03:11.424 --> 00:03:14.594
But I started to be so
aware of the consequences

00:03:14.661 --> 00:03:16.696
of my father's
actions because I was

00:03:16.763 --> 00:03:18.631
forced to hide more than he.

00:03:18.698 --> 00:03:20.099
He was more free than--

00:03:20.166 --> 00:03:21.834
than I was in that time.

00:03:21.901 --> 00:03:23.703
[siren]

00:03:23.770 --> 00:03:49.162
[speaking in spanish]

00:03:49.228 --> 00:03:49.996
[boom]

00:03:50.063 --> 00:03:50.964
[crash]

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:54.767
[sirens]

00:03:59.138 --> 00:04:40.146
MAR A ISABEL SANTOS:
[speaking in spanish]

00:04:40.213 --> 00:04:52.592
REPORTER: [speaking in spanish]

00:04:52.659 --> 00:04:55.795
And my father became
even more crazy than ever

00:04:55.862 --> 00:04:59.732
because he felt for one
hour that all of his family

00:04:59.799 --> 00:05:00.933
were dead.

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:03.803
[speaking in spanish]

